Recommends: firefox-esr-l10n-nb-no, firefox-esr-l10n-nn-no, thunderbird-l10n-nb-no, thunderbird-l10n-nn-no, libreoffice-l10n-nb, libreoffice-l10n-nn, libreoffice-help-en-us, hunspell-no | myspell-nb, hunspell-en-us
Installed-Size: 4
Description: Tind default applications
 The pre-installed Tind application set: LibreOffice, Firefox ESR with
 restricted defaults and uBlock Origin, Thunderbird, and the WireGuard tunnel
 tooling for servr.no. Proton VPN is added from Proton's own repository by the
 image build (see the build documentation), not from Debian.
